#WasteWise-AI Waste Identifier & Value Creator
## Introduction
WasteWise is an AI-based project designed to identify different types of waste and encourage proper waste management.

## Objective
To make waste identification easier and promote recycling awareness.

## Key Features
- Waste image identification
- Waste classification
- Recycling awareness
- User-friendly interface

## Technologies
- Python
- Artificial Intelligence
- Machine Learning

## Project Status
Currently in the initial development stage.
